actual_output:
Essential Qualification: M.Pharm (Pharmaceutical Chemistry) or equivalent

Desirable Qualifications:
1. Prior experience in QSAR/Read-across or related model development;
2. GPAT qualification;
3. QSAR/read-across-related publications

The Education Officer (Admn) is requested to take further necessary action in the matter. The circular should be copied to:
1. All Officers/ Sections;
2. UGC Branch Office, 35 Ferozeshah Road, New Delhi;
3. UGC NET Bureau, South Campus of Delhi University, New Delhi;
4. All Regional Offices;
5. DS (FD)/ EO(FD-I/A&B)/SO (FD-I/A&B) with the request to take further action in the matter;
6. CU/DU/DC/IUC with a request for circulation among those institutions only after implementation of VIIth CPC.
7. UGC e-office;
UGC website
